{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年58歲的劉彩玉，多年來一直主持無綫午間節目《流行都市》，惟近日被網民發現已一段時間未有在節目露面，其藝員介紹亦從無綫官方網站消失，疑已約滿離巢，與無綫結束32年賓主關係。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T06:25:16.312563+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":87,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T05:43:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:22.630373+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:18:22.941990+00:00","content_hash":"e5f17c994b64c44f646d1768fcb051d27224252ba718ee735f5a1d1cf173531b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}